\textbf{CaCLR} & \textbf{0.763} & \textbf{0.121} & \textbf{0.732} & \textbf{0.131} & EN + parallel \\
Linear proj (50)& 0.790 & 0.139 & 0.749 & 0.146 & 50 pairs \\
